        "excerpt": "# Brand positioning & secret sauce — Bulgaria 2026\n\n**Date:** 2026-06-19  \n**Analyst:** Dev Agent (brand sprint)  \n**Confidence:** high on competitor positioning; medium on pricing (VCA pre-launch)\n\n## Summary\n\n“Vibe coding” in Bulgaria is **already claimed** by SoftUni AI as **no-code / beginner** software creation via Bolt, Lovable, and Replit ([SoftUni AI program](https://ai.softuni.bg/application-vibe-coding)). Vibe Coders Academy must **not** compete on that definition. The defensible position is **agentic engineering for developers who already code** — Cursor rules, skills, MCP integrations, and automations that ship production repos. Secondary competitors (Telerik GenAI sprint, NobleProg corporate Cursor training) validate demand but lack cohort + capstone + founder-led automation stack positioning.\n\n## Offer & positioning\n\n| Player | Positioning | Audience | Overlap with VCA |\n|--------|-------------|----------|------------------|\n| SoftUni AI Vibe Coding | No-code apps via AI prompts; large academy brand | Beginners, career explorers | **Name collision only** — different ICP |\n| SoftUni AI Agents / Copilot courses | Tool training at scale | Devs + business users | Adjacent…",
